# Repurposing Bay (CR 111.4, 202.3): a Treasure token has no mana cost, so its mana value is 0 and sacrificing it to the Bay searches for a
# mana value 1 artifact. Turn 1 Deadly Dispute sacrifices Mox Pearl and makes the Treasure (drawing two Islands); in turn 3 the Bay
# sacrifices the Treasure: Sol Ring is found, Mind Stone (mana value 2) is not a choice.

